values ('a9b0c1d2-3e4f-4a41-8b11-1c2d3e4f5a31', 'business-analytics-data-analysis', 'Business Analytics / Data Analysis', 'This course prepares students to turn business questions into data-driven decisions. Students learn the full analytics workflow: problem framing, data literacy, cleaning, spreadsheet modeling, SQL and BI foundations, exploratory analysis, visualization, statistical inference, regression, forecasting, experimentation, optimization, simulation, machine learning basics, supply-chain applications, ethics, governance, and executive communication. The course culminates in an applied analytics project that produces a defensible recommendation for a real business decision.');

